#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:21
msgid "FAIR & Impact"
msgstr "FAIR & Impact"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:22
msgid "User guide"
msgstr "Guide utilisateur"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:32
msgid "Completeness"
msgstr "Complétude"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:33
msgid ""
"How complete the FAIR3R metadata of this dataset is: the weighted share of "
"the fields that apply (required fields count double), CKAN basics included. "
"Conditional fields that are hidden are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Niveau de complétude des métadonnées FAIR3R de ce dataset : part pondérée "
"des champs applicables (les champs obligatoires comptent double), en "
"incluant les champs de base de CKAN. Les champs conditionnels masqués sont "
"ignorés."

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:41
msgid "Missing fields"
msgstr "Champs manquants"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:54
msgid "Citations"
msgstr "Citations"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:59
msgid "last checked"
msgstr "dernière vérification"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:66
msgid "Disruption index"
msgstr "Indice de disruption"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:67
msgid ""
"Wu, Wang & Evans (2019). Between -1 and +1: close to +1 means the works "
"citing this dataset tend to replace it; close to -1 means they build on it "
"together with its own references. Uses the dataset References/Cites related "
"identifiers when present. To stay fast, only a limited number of references "
"and citing works are used: when references are widely cited, the index stays"
" close to 0, so use it to compare datasets, not as an absolute value."
msgstr ""
"Wu, Wang & Evans (2019). Entre -1 et +1 : proche de +1, les œuvres citant ce"
" dataset tendent à le remplacer ; proche de -1, elles s'appuient aussi sur "
"ses références. Utilise les identifiants liés References/Cites du dataset "
"quand ils existent. Pour rester rapide, seul un nombre limité de références "
"et d'œuvres citantes est utilisé : quand les références sont très citées, "
"l'indice reste proche de 0, il sert donc à comparer des datasets, pas comme "
"valeur absolue."

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:73
msgid "not enough data yet"
msgstr "pas assez de données pour l'instant"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:80
#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:91
msgid "S-index"
msgstr "S-index"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:81
msgid ""
"Distinct researchers (identified by ORCID, or by name when no ORCID) that "
"the FAIR3R datasets of this author have reached since tracking started. "
"Cumulative: a researcher is never removed, even if a citation later "
"disappears. Shown for the highest co-author with an ORCID."
msgstr ""
"Chercheurs distincts (identifiés par ORCID, ou par nom à défaut) que les "
"datasets FAIR3R de cet auteur ont atteints depuis le début du suivi. "
"Cumulatif : un chercheur n'est jamais retiré, même si sa citation disparaît."
" Affiché pour le co-auteur ayant le plus haut score, parmi ceux qui ont un "
"ORCID."

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:86
msgid "highest among co-authors"
msgstr "le plus élevé parmi les co-auteurs"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:88
msgid "All co-authors"
msgstr "Tous les co-auteurs"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:104
msgid ""
"Citations, disruption index and S-index are shown once this dataset is "
"public."
msgstr ""
"Les citations, l'indice de disruption et le S-index sont affichés une fois "
"ce jeu de données rendu public."

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:106
msgid ""
"Not checked yet: citations are tracked once the dataset has a published DOI."
msgstr ""
"Pas encore vérifié : les citations sont suivies une fois le dataset publié "
"avec un DOI."

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:110
msgid "Citing works"
msgstr "Œuvres citantes"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:114
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titre"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:115
msgid "Authors"
msgstr "Auteurs"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:116
msgid "Year"
msgstr "Année"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:117
msgid "Venue"
msgstr "Revue"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:118
msgid "DOI"
msgstr "DOI"

#: ckanext/citations/templates/package/snippets/citations_panel.html:141
#, python-format
msgid "Show all %(count)s citing works"
msgstr "Afficher les %(count)s œuvres citantes"

